c cards early and was threatened by them when he did a YouTube video about it. The pinkertons still being about was surprise enough.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Not only that. That guy later found out that they came around during the day before but since it was a workday he and his wife weren't home, so instead these Pinkerton-guys started going to the neighbors of the guy and asking questions about them under the pretense that they were there for a meeting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-02T02:26:33-07:00","id":1510475,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1500539-dungeons-and-drama?p=1510473#post1510473\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not only that. That guy later found out that they came around during the day before but since it was a workday he and his wife weren't home, so instead these Pinkerton-guys started going to the neighbors of the guy and asking questions about them under the pretense that they were there for a meeting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bloody hell, say what you want about parawolfs relationship with the fanbase but it isn't &quot;proactively hostile irl.&quot; This company needs to go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,